      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786592152256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. We will use level order traversal on each stage \n2. if node.right exists push that in the result , move to next level \n3. if node.right does not exists go the left\n4. problem , if we keep going right , we can't explore other nodes\n5. solution can be : save both left and right nodes\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. We will use level order traversal on each stage \n2. if node.right exists push that in the result , move to next level \n3. if node.right does not exists go the left\n4. problem , if we keep going right , we can't explore other nodes\n5. solution can be : save both left and right nodes\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
